INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (175, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI121', 'Sitar + Drum and Bass instrumental. Sitar plays rapid microtonal melodic runs with buzzing sympathetic string resonance and sharp plucked attacks across ascending phrases. Fast breakbeat delivers chopped syncopated patterns with snappy snare rolls and cascading hi-hat fills at relentless pace. Reese bass provides a deep detuned growl with phasing modulation and heavy sub-frequency pulses that rumble beneath the melodic lines. The arrangement is a volatile collision of ancient string tradition and futuristic electronic aggression, with filtered breakdowns giving way to explosive bass surges. 174 BPM in A Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Sitar + Drum and Bass', 174, 'A Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Build-Drop, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (176, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI122', 'Erhu + Ambient instrumental. Erhu plays slow, mournful melodic lines with expressive vibrato and long sustained bows that bend between microtonal intervals. Synth pad provides a vast, evolving harmonic bed with gentle filter sweeps and warm layered textures that drift beneath the melody. Distant percussion enters with sparse, muted strikes and soft metallic shimmers that dissolve into reverb tails. The arrangement is contemplative and glacial, embracing wide silences between each erhu phrase. 45 BPM in C# Minor, 3/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Erhu + Ambient', 45, 'C# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Free-form, 3/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (177, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI123', 'Banjo + Electronica instrumental. Banjo plays bright fingerpicked arpeggiated patterns with crisp metallic string attacks and rapid hammer-on rolls that bounce across syncopated rhythms. Electronic beats deliver tight quantized kick and snare patterns with glitchy hi-hat stutters and filtered percussion fills. Synth bass provides a warm, pulsing low-end foundation with sidechain compression ducking beneath each kick hit. The arrangement is playful and propulsive, blending acoustic twang with polished electronic production through seamless dynamic builds. 128 BPM in Bb Major, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Banjo + Electronica', 128, 'Bb Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (178, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI124', 'Koto + Jazz instrumental. Koto plays delicate pentatonic phrases with precise plucked attacks and subtle string bends that linger with natural resonance. Upright bass provides a warm walking line with legato fingered notes and occasional slides between chord tones. Brush drums deliver soft swishing patterns on the snare with gentle cymbal touches and understated kick accents on beats one and three. The arrangement is intimate and unhurried, with each instrument conversing in a spacious call-and-response dialogue. 95 BPM in F# Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Koto + Jazz', 95, 'F# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 AABA, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (179, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI125', 'Accordion + Trance instrumental. Accordion plays soaring legato melodic lines with rich bellows swells and expressive chromatic runs that climb through harmonic tension. Supersaw synth provides a massive layered harmonic wash with wide stereo detuning and filtered sweeps that build toward euphoric peaks. Four-on-the-floor kick delivers a relentless driving pulse with tight compression and punchy low-end impact on every beat. The arrangement is an escalating fusion of folk emotion and electronic ecstasy, with long filtered builds breaking into full-frequency release. 138 BPM in Db Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Accordion + Trance', 138, 'Db Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Build-Drop, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (180, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI126', 'Bagpipe + Metal instrumental. Bagpipe plays piercing sustained drone harmonics with ornamental grace notes and powerful melodic phrases that cut above the distortion. Distorted guitar delivers crushing palm-muted riffs with thick low-end crunch and aggressive power chord progressions that lock with the percussion. Blast beats provide an unrelenting barrage of rapid double-kick patterns with machine-gun snare rolls and crashing cymbals. The arrangement is ferocious and ceremonial, with the bagpipe''s ancient wail riding atop a wall of modern metallic fury. 165 BPM in Ab Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Bagpipe + Metal', 165, 'Ab Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (181, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI127', 'Steel Drum + Hip-Hop instrumental. Steel drum plays bright melodic phrases with shimmering metallic resonance and rhythmic staccato patterns that bounce across the beat. 808 bass provides deep sustained sub-bass hits with heavy distortion and pitch-bent slides that anchor the low end. Hi-hat triplets deliver rapid mechanical patterns with crisp open and closed alternations and subtle velocity variations. The arrangement is laid-back and sun-drenched, with the tropical warmth of the steel drum floating above hard-hitting trap percussion. 88 BPM in Eb Major, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Steel Drum + Hip-Hop', 88, 'Eb Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (182, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI128', 'Oud + Dubstep instrumental. Oud plays intricate fingerpicked melodic runs with rapid ornamental trills and resonant open-string drones that ring between phrases. Wobble bass provides a massive modulated low-end with aggressive LFO sweeps and gritty distorted growls that pulse in rhythmic patterns. Half-time drums deliver heavy snare hits on the three with deep kick accents and sparse hi-hat taps that leave space for the bass to breathe. The arrangement is dark and hypnotic, with the oud''s ancient ornamentation weaving through walls of synthetic bass pressure. 140 BPM in Bb Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Oud + Dubstep', 140, 'Bb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Build-Drop, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (183, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI129', 'Guzheng + Lo-fi instrumental. Guzheng plays gentle cascading arpeggios with soft plucked attacks and delicate tremolo passages that shimmer through pentatonic intervals. Vinyl crackle provides a warm textural layer of analog surface noise and subtle pops that wrap the sound in nostalgic haze. Soft electronic beat delivers a muted kick-snare pattern with dusty hi-hats and tape-warped timing that drifts slightly behind the grid. The arrangement is dreamy and lo-fi, with the guzheng''s crystalline tone softened by layers of warm saturation. 78 BPM in F# Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Guzheng + Lo-fi', 78, 'F# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (184, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI130', 'Tango + Electronica instrumental. Bandoneón plays passionate legato phrases with dramatic bellows swells and sharp staccato punctuations that snap with rhythmic precision. Electronic beats deliver a tight four-on-the-floor foundation with sidechained compression and crisp clap accents on the backbeat. Synth strings provide lush sustained harmonic pads with slow filter modulation and wide stereo spread that fill the midrange warmth. The arrangement is sultry and modern, with the bandoneón''s raw emotional intensity framed by polished electronic production. 78 BPM in Ab Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Tango + Electronica', 78, 'Ab Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 AABB, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (185, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI131', 'Celtic + Drum and Bass instrumental. Tin whistle plays rapid ornamental melodic runs with breathy articulation and crisp tongued triplets that dance across jig-like phrases. Fast breakbeat delivers chopped Amen-style patterns with rolling snare fills and frenetic hi-hat cascades at breakneck tempo. Reese bass provides a deep phasing sub-bass growl with heavy modulation and distorted mid-range harmonics that pulse beneath the melody. The arrangement is wild and exhilarating, with traditional Celtic ornamentation riding atop relentless jungle-speed percussion. 172 BPM in A Major, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Celtic + Drum and Bass', 172, 'A Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Build-Drop, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (186, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI132', 'Didgeridoo + Ambient instrumental. Didgeridoo plays a deep circular-breathing drone with rich overtone harmonics and rhythmic tongue articulations that pulse within the sustained fundamental tone. Drone pad provides an expansive low-frequency bed with glacial harmonic movement and subtle timbral shifts that evolve across minutes. Rain stick enters with cascading percussive textures and gentle rattling patterns that fade in and out like distant weather. The arrangement is primordial and vast, with the didgeridoo''s ancient vibration merging into an immersive sonic landscape. 35 BPM in Db Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Didgeridoo + Ambient', 35, 'Db Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Free-form, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (187, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI133', 'Vaporwave instrumental. Lo-fi synthesizer plays pitch-shifted melodic fragments with heavy detuning and slowed-down arpeggiated patterns that warp through nostalgic haze. Pitch-shifted sample provides chopped and screwed vocal textures with extreme time-stretching and reverb-drenched repetition that loops hypnotically. Retro pad delivers warm analog-style sustained chords with chorus modulation and soft high-frequency rolloff that evokes faded memory. The arrangement is dreamy and disorienting, bathed in artificial reverb and deliberate degradation of fidelity. 85 BPM in Ab Major, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Vaporwave', 85, 'Ab Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (188, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI134', 'Tech House instrumental. Punchy kick delivers a tight compressed attack with short decay and deep low-end body that drives the four-on-the-floor groove. Rolling bassline provides a syncopated staccato pattern with filtered resonance sweeps and rhythmic sidechain pumping that locks with the kick. Hi-hat pattern plays rapid sixteenth-note sequences with subtle open-hat accents and crisp metallic attacks that create hypnotic forward momentum. The arrangement is minimal and functional, with gradual filter automation and sparse percussive fills building tension across looping cycles. 126 BPM in F Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Tech House', 126, 'F Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (189, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI135', 'Deep House instrumental. Warm pad plays sustained filtered chords with gentle modulation and lush stereo layering that creates an enveloping harmonic atmosphere. Deep bass provides a smooth round sub-bass tone with legato melodic movement and subtle pitch slides between root notes. Organic percussion delivers live-sounding shaker patterns with soft conga hits and natural room ambiance that adds warmth to the electronic foundation. The arrangement is smooth and immersive, with slow evolving textures and patient dynamic builds across extended passages. 122 BPM in Bb Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Deep House', 122, 'Bb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Build-Drop, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (190, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI136', 'Grime instrumental. Aggressive synth stab delivers sharp square-wave hits with heavy distortion and rapid-fire rhythmic patterns that punctuate the sparse arrangement. Deep sub-bass provides a massive low-frequency presence with sustained notes and occasional pitch-bent drops that rattle the low end. Percussive hi-hat plays rapid triplet patterns with crisp metallic attacks and stuttered fills that add frenetic energy between the stabs. The arrangement is dark and confrontational, with stripped-back production that lets each element hit with maximum impact. 140 BPM in C# Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Grime', 140, 'C# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (191, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI137', 'Memphis Phonk instrumental. Lo-fi 808 delivers heavy distorted bass hits with long sustained tails and pitched slides that drag through murky low frequencies. Pitched vocal sample provides eerie chopped fragments with aggressive processing and looped repetition that creates an ominous hypnotic texture. Tape-saturated drums feature crunchy compressed snare hits with lo-fi kick patterns and hissing hi-hats drenched in analog warmth and grit. The arrangement is grimy and menacing, with deliberate tape degradation and raw unpolished production that embraces sonic imperfection. 130 BPM in Ab Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Memphis Phonk', 130, 'Ab Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (192, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI138', 'Dembow instrumental. Deep 808 bass delivers sustained low-frequency hits with heavy distortion and pitch slides that anchor the rhythmic foundation. Dembow drum pattern provides the signature syncopated kick-snare groove with a bouncing two-bar rhythm and sharp rimshot accents that drive the body-moving pulse. Synth stab plays short filtered chord hits with bright attack and rapid decay that punctuate the off-beat spaces between drum hits. The arrangement is stripped and danceable, with the relentless dembow groove maintaining unwavering momentum throughout. 100 BPM in Bb Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Dembow', 100, 'Bb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (193, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI139', 'Black Metal Ambient instrumental. Tremolo-picked guitar plays relentless sixteenth-note patterns with raw distorted tone and blurred harmonic textures that create a wall of buzzing dissonance. Synth pad provides an ethereal atmospheric layer with cold reverb-drenched tones and slowly shifting minor harmonies beneath the guitar wash. Sparse drums enter with distant blast beats that fade into muffled fills and occasional isolated cymbal crashes swallowed by reverb. The arrangement is bleak and expansive, merging black metal aggression with vast ambient space into a frozen sonic landscape. 160 BPM in Db Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Black Metal Ambient', 160, 'Db Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Through-composed, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (194, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI140', 'Metalcore instrumental. Down-tuned guitar plays crushing chugged riffs with tight palm-muted staccato attacks and explosive open-chord breakdowns that slam with maximum heaviness. Screamed vocals tag provides aggressive textural shouts layered as rhythmic accents with raw distorted processing and guttural intensity. Breakdown drums deliver punishing half-time patterns with thunderous kick hits and crashing china cymbals that punctuate each riff transition with brutal impact. The arrangement is relentless and dynamic, alternating between high-speed tremolo sections and devastating slow breakdowns. 150 BPM in C# Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Metalcore', 150, 'C# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Breakdown, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (195, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI141', 'Slowcore instrumental. Sparse clean guitar plays minimal arpeggiated figures with crystalline tone and wide reverb trails that hang in the silence between notes. Brushed snare provides gentle swishing patterns with soft ghost notes and restrained accents that barely disturb the stillness. Fretless bass delivers smooth legato lines with subtle slides between notes and a warm woody tone that anchors the low frequencies without imposing. The arrangement is austere and patient, with deliberate empty space functioning as a structural element between each fragile musical gesture. 55 BPM in F# Minor, 3/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Slowcore', 55, 'F# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 3/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (196, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI142', 'Jangle Pop instrumental. Bright arpeggiated 12-string plays cascading chordal patterns with shimmering chorus-treated tone and rapid alternate picking that creates a sparkling harmonic wash. Bass guitar provides a melodic walking foundation with round fingered tone and ascending scalar runs that complement the jangly treble. Upbeat drums deliver a driving four-on-the-floor kick with crisp snare backbeats and splashy ride cymbal patterns that push the tempo forward. The arrangement is sunny and energetic, with the 12-string''s crystalline shimmer dominating a bright polished mix. 128 BPM in A Major, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Jangle Pop', 128, 'A Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (197, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI143', 'Post-punk instrumental. Chorus delay guitar plays angular single-note riffs with cold metallic tone and rhythmic staccato picking that locks into mechanical repetition. Prominent bass guitar delivers a driving melodic lead with aggressive fingered attack and a thick distorted tone that carries the harmonic content above the guitar. Gated snare provides a sharp explosive hit with abrupt decay and no ring, paired with tight kick patterns and metronomic hi-hat clicks. The arrangement is austere and propulsive, with the bass leading and the guitar functioning as rhythmic texture. 142 BPM in Db Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Post-punk', 142, 'Db Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (198, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI144', 'Neo-folk instrumental. Dark acoustic guitar plays somber fingerpicked arpeggios with nylon-string warmth and deliberate downward melodic movement that evokes a mournful quality. Drone cello provides a sustained bowed pedal tone with slow vibrato and a dark resonant timbre that hums beneath the guitar figures. Frame drum enters with soft hand-struck patterns and muted low thuds that follow a steady processional pulse. The arrangement is sparse and ritualistic, with each element occupying its own acoustic space in a cavernous reverberant field. 60 BPM in Eb Minor, 3/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Neo-folk', 60, 'Eb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Strophic, 3/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (199, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI145', 'Outlaw Country instrumental. Acoustic guitar plays driving strummed chord patterns with a bright dreadnought tone and percussive muted downstrokes that anchor the rhythmic groove. Upright bass provides a deep thumping foundation with slapped attacks and walking quarter-note lines that propel the shuffling momentum. Pedal steel delivers smooth sustained bends with glassy harmonics and long crying slides between notes that float above the rhythm section. The arrangement is raw and honest, with sparse production that lets each instrument ring with unprocessed clarity. 100 BPM in A Major, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Outlaw Country', 100, 'A Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (200, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI146', 'Drift Phonk instrumental. Distorted cowbell plays a relentless rhythmic pattern with harsh clipping distortion and metallic ring that cuts through the dense mix. Aggressive 808 delivers massive low-frequency hits with extreme distortion and pitch-bent slides that growl beneath the cowbell assault. Dark synth provides ominous sustained pads with detuned oscillators and gritty low-pass filtering that fills the background with menacing atmosphere. The arrangement is aggressive and hypnotic, with the distorted cowbell driving an unrelenting loop of heavy bass and dark texture. 134 BPM in Ab Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Drift Phonk', 134, 'Ab Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Loop-based, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (201, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI147', 'Solo Cello instrumental. Cello plays expressive sustained phrases with deep bowing and controlled vibrato that swells through long melodic arcs. The tone shifts between warm legato in the lower register and tense sul ponticello textures. Pizzicato passages add rhythmic contrast. 48 BPM in Eb Minor, 3/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Solo Cello', 48, 'Eb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Through-composed, 3/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (202, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI148', 'Solo Acoustic Guitar instrumental. Fingerpicked acoustic guitar plays intricate melodic patterns with warm steel-string resonance and alternating bass-note thumb patterns. Travis-style picking delivers cascading arpeggios with natural harmonics and hammer-on embellishments. The tone is warm with natural room ambiance. 72 BPM in Db Major, 6/8 time signature.', NULL, 'Solo Acoustic Guitar', 72, 'Db Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Through-composed, 6/8', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (203, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI149', 'Saxophone + Piano instrumental. Tenor saxophone plays warm breathy melodic lines with expressive vibrato and gentle pitch bends. Piano provides sparse voiced chords with soft pedal sustain and single-note melodic responses. The arrangement is late-night and reflective with generous silence between phrases. 68 BPM in Bb Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Saxophone + Piano', 68, 'Bb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 AABA, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (204, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI150', 'Violin + Harp instrumental. Violin plays lyrical sustained melodies with warm legato bowing and expressive vibrato. Harp provides flowing arpeggiated accompaniment with crystalline plucked attacks and glissando sweeps. The arrangement is elegant and pastoral with delicate counterpoint between the two voices. 85 BPM in F# Minor, 3/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Violin + Harp', 85, 'F# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Binary (AB), 3/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (205, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI151', 'Solo Harp instrumental. Concert harp plays flowing arpeggiated passages with resonant plucked attacks and cascading glissandi across the full range. Melodic phrases emerge through delicate single-note lines with natural harmonic overtones. The tone is crystalline and spacious with pedal-sustained resonance. 62 BPM in Ab Major, 3/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Solo Harp', 62, 'Ab Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Through-composed, 3/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (206, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI152', 'Organ Fugue instrumental. Pipe organ plays a contrapuntal fugue building from a single melodic voice into dense four-part polyphony across multiple manuals and pedal board. Registration shifts between bright principal stops and rich reed combinations. Pedal notes provide thunderous low-frequency resonance. The arrangement escalates through stretto passages toward a full-organ climax. 72 BPM in C# Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Organ Fugue', 72, 'C# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Fugue, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (207, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI153', 'Aksak Folk instrumental. Zurna plays a piercing nasal melodic line with sharp ornamental grace notes and rapid trills that wind through modal intervals with insistent energy. Davul provides a deep booming bass stroke paired with a sharp stick-side crack in the signature asymmetric aksak pattern that drives the 9/8 groove. Tambura delivers a continuous droning strum with bright metallic string resonance that sustains the tonal center beneath the melody. The arrangement is festive and raw, with the zurna''s commanding voice leading an outdoor celebratory dance rhythm. 130 BPM in Bb Minor, 9/8 time signature.', NULL, 'Aksak Folk', 130, 'Bb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Strophic, 9/8', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (208, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI154', 'Prog Jazz instrumental. Piano plays angular melodic fragments with dissonant cluster voicings and rapid chromatic runs that shift unpredictably between tonal centers. Upright bass provides a deep anchoring presence with aggressive pizzicato attacks and melodic counterlines that challenge the piano''s harmonic direction. The drums feature complex polyrhythmic patterns with displaced accents across the 11/8 meter and explosive fills that fragment and reassemble the groove. The arrangement is intellectually demanding and spontaneous, with tight ensemble interplay navigating through constantly shifting time feels. 130 BPM in Eb Minor, 11/8 time signature.', NULL, 'Prog Jazz', 130, 'Eb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Through-composed, 11/8', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (209, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI155', 'Indian Tabla Solo instrumental. Tabla plays intricate rhythmic compositions with rapid finger strikes producing crisp na and tin tones alongside deep resonant ge bass strokes. Patterns build from deliberate phrases into cascading tihai cadences across the 7/8 cycle. Tanpura provides a constant droning foundation with shimmering overtone-rich open strings. 90 BPM in Db Major, 7/8 time signature.', NULL, 'Indian Tabla Solo', 90, 'Db Major', 'S_INST200 session4 Through-composed, 7/8', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (210, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI156', 'Extratone instrumental. Hyper-speed kick delivers an impossibly rapid stream of bass drum hits that blur into a continuous buzzing tone at extreme tempo. Noise texture provides harsh digital static with bitcrushed artifacts and aggressive high-frequency distortion that fills the sonic spectrum. Dissonant synth plays atonal sustained tones with clashing intervals and metallic ring modulation that adds an abrasive harmonic layer. The arrangement is deliberately overwhelming, pushing the boundary of rhythmic perception into pure textural noise. 300 BPM in A Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Extratone', 300, 'A Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Free-form, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (211, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI157', 'Noise Ambient instrumental. White noise provides a sustained broadband wash with slowly modulated filter sweeps that sculpt the static into evolving tonal shapes. Feedback drone delivers a high-pitched sustained oscillation with natural harmonic overtones and gradual pitch drift that shifts unpredictably. Reversed cymbal enters with swelling crescendos that build from silence into bright metallic washes before cutting abruptly. The arrangement is glacial and textural, existing at the boundary between sound and silence with vast expanses of near-stillness. 30 BPM in C# Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Noise Ambient', 30, 'C# Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Free-form, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (212, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI158', 'Zouk instrumental. Synthesizer plays warm melodic phrases with lush pad textures and gentle portamento slides between notes that give a smooth flowing quality. Electric guitar provides clean rhythmic comping with muted staccato strums and bright chord voicings that accent the off-beat syncopations. Ka drum delivers the signature zouk groove with a deep bass tone on the downbeat and sharp high-pitched slaps that create an infectious danceable pattern. The arrangement is tropical and sensual, with the synthesizer''s warmth blending with the guitar''s rhythmic pulse. 108 BPM in F Minor, 4/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Zouk', 108, 'F Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Verse-Chorus, 4/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (213, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI159', 'Berlin School instrumental. Sequenced synth plays a repetitive sixteenth-note pattern with analog oscillator warmth and gradual filter cutoff modulation that reveals new overtones across minutes. Arpeggiated synth provides an interlocking melodic sequence with detuned voices and evolving step patterns that shift against the main sequence. Atmospheric pad delivers a vast harmonic wash with slow-attack envelopes and deep reverb. The arrangement is hypnotic and evolutionary, with patient incremental changes unfolding over extended duration. 42 BPM in Db Minor, 5/4 time signature.', NULL, 'Berlin School', 42, 'Db Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Free-form, 5/4', 'experimental');
INSERT INTO songs_test_lab (test_id, batch, source_project, creator, title, style_prompt, lyrics, genre, bpm, key_signature, note, status) VALUES (214, 'S_INST200', 'sunolanguage', 'sunolanguage', 'SI160', 'Glitch instrumental. Granular synthesis plays fragmented tonal textures with rapidly sliced audio grains and pitch-scattered particles that shimmer in clouds of micro-sounds. Detuned piano provides prepared-piano-like tones with mistuned strings and processed attacks that fracture into granular artifacts. Stuttered percussion delivers chopped rhythmic patterns with rapid-fire edits that skip and glitch across the asymmetric 11/8 meter. The arrangement is unpredictable and precise, assembling digital errors into intentional sonic architecture. 110 BPM in Eb Minor, 11/8 time signature.', NULL, 'Glitch', 110, 'Eb Minor', 'S_INST200 session4 Free-form, 11/8', 'experimental');
